{"server":"cn","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_04_end","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_04","title":"烤串与预言","storyCode":"DT-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"937c338081041ce7c49055586a44b245f85c5c79a5eac4dbc7762e6f047577b3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在一路小心翼翼地见识了萨米的各种奇观之后，齐尔查克未能阻止小队其他几人吃下看起来非常诡异的角兽肉，只能看着他们陷入坍缩。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的名字是艾尔启。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我预见到今天在这片森林中会有厄运降临，于是来到这附近徘徊，结果发现了在雪地里昏倒的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有见到我的同伴们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，我得去找他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你伤得不轻，先在这里休息一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎不是萨米人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和我的伙伴们在寻找回家的线索，有一个叫橡杯的人告诉我们，萨米的意志指引我们往北走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡杯......橡树之子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有所耳闻，这个名字在萨米与“智慧”同义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“智慧”......？那......你知道独眼巨人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过许多人被厄运缠身，死亡......并不是一件少见的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，为什么我在你的身上看到了许多死亡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是没找到齐尔查克吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一值得庆幸的是，这附近的积雪相当厚，而且树木繁多，以齐尔查克的身手，他应该不会有大问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但是齐尔查克缺乏自保能力，我们还是要尽快找到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让他遇到那头跑走的奇怪角兽那就凶多吉少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。而且，我们现在还有一个问题——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......这不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，小姐，为什么你会一个人在这片森林里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我在这里打猎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你生活在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是哦，我生活在罗德岛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛？！我们正在找罗德岛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？你们要去罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们正在找回家的路，据说罗德岛上会有线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们找不到家了吗？好可怜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以带我们去找罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，但是我还不想回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我还没吃够呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有吃够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们让你吃饱的话，你愿意带我们去罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，可以哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没想到，真的在这种地方找到了线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，其实这就是萨米的指引？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没找到这次的猎物呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有食物——啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们的食物也在刚才丢失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看这样可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先帮我们找到我们的同伴，然后，我们一起帮你狩猎你想要的猎物，最后，你带我们去罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！好哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是个纯真的孩子。你叫什么名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是刻俄柏，你们可以叫我小刻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我身上看到了死亡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多死亡，从过去延绵到未来，但你却活着站在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个橡杯说，独眼巨人能看到未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是独眼巨人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么现在，告诉我，我的命运是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......独眼巨人只能看到厄运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄运也没关系，告诉我，我的命运，我伙伴的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的伙伴们向着无尽冰原走去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们并不是自愿往北走的，他们......被黑暗、被虚无吞噬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们被邪魔污染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邪魔？！那是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邪魔......是游荡在这片土地上的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们会侵蚀和覆盖一切物质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而被邪魔污染的生物，会失去一切的自我，如同被虚无吞噬一般——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脸上会有一个圆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像是脸上有一只眼一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你、你们已经见过被邪魔污染的生物了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"齐尔查克思索了片刻，捂着受伤的手臂，朝着洞外走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄运是可以避免的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于这个问题，我的回答是——我在尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我也该试一试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，罗德岛是一艘巨大的舰船？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！罗德岛可大了，而且会开去各种各样的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，难怪我们一直都找不到它的位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是血的味道，是我的猎物，“独眼怪”就在这附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是敏锐的嗅觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？小刻，你刚才说，“独眼怪”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，这个角兽脸上只有一只眼睛，不就是“独眼怪”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......你们还记得橡杯说的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说的是独眼巨人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会独眼巨人只是他的推断，而不是结论？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会萨米意志的意思并不是让我们去找独眼巨人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实是祂预知到了我们会遇到小刻，也知道我们会遇到这种“角兽”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，既然在这里遇到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就先解决掉它吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它死透了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这样也算帮齐尔查克出了口气吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们快去找他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫有个建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其在这里漫无目的地寻找齐尔查克，不如就地生火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也有把野兽引来的可能性，但是齐尔查克也能看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......可是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔，饿着肚子干什么都不会有效率的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算最后他没来，我们先填饱肚子也能更有效率地去找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这头“独眼”角兽怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起吃掉它吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，老夫也认为应该吃掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫听说过一些习俗，在有些地方，人们会选择杀掉用于祭祀的动物并吃掉它，希望以此获得神灵的启示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫猜测，萨米的意志可能也希望我们这样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别掩饰了，你从一开始就抱着这个念头吧，莱欧斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，开始生火吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿齐尔查克能够看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——说实在的，这个肉看起来好诡异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫已经品尝过了，和普通的肉没什么太大的区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，比这更诡异的东西我也吃过了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的还蛮好吃的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻——你在那边干什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在这边看看还有没有别的大家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好像没有了，但是也没看到掉下去的那个杜林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先过来一起吃吧，然后我们一起去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，我这就来——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你是摔下去的杜林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是窜出来的那家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我害你掉下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......没事，比起这个，你们没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们没事哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说嘛，厄运果然是可以避免的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们正在那边烤肉，打算填饱肚子就去找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起过去吧，他们见到你肯定很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这帮家伙，真是什么时候都不会忘了吃，亏我还这么担心他们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，烤肉？烤什么肉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“独眼怪”的肉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“独眼怪”？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......该不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，他们过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，这下我非得好好说说他们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说你们啊——"},{"type":"narration","text":"齐尔查克转过身去，正想要好好说说丢下自己烤肉的伙伴们。\n然而，话到嘴边却卡住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该回家了，各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这个世界待了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法琳一定等急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔像上种的菜该收了，炎龙还在等着老夫去料理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们的脸，已经不是自己熟悉的面孔，而是被虚空覆盖。\n他们发出的声音，也变得有些断断续续，齐尔查克甚至无法判断，他们是从哪里发声的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......把被邪魔污染的角兽吃了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"齐尔■■，你为什么还■在那里？走■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法琳，法■，■■——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北边，去北■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽头，门，回家，回■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北边有一扇可以回家的门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是萨米的指引的含义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你们是怎么知道的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们■■，我们来自那■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■回那■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甬首，豕，去林——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■■，■■，■■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■■■■■■■■■■炎龙■■■■■■！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一时间，齐尔查克的心情无比复杂。\n他感到惊慌失措——看来厄运确实无法避免，自己的队友陷入了非常令人担忧的状态，他却有些无能为力。\n可他又有点生气......\n因为眼下的情况......根本就是他们自作自受啊！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i7"},{"type":"narration","text":"齐尔查克确信自己只是眨了一下眼，但是三个人不知为何已经出现在了距离他很近的地方。\n而下一秒，他们就来到了自己的身边。\n从他的视角来看，他们完全就是一闪一闪地在移动，仿佛空间也被他们脸上的空洞吞噬了一样。\n很快，他们就消失在了树林深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i7_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"齐尔查克呆立片刻，终于还是深深叹了口气。\n他听到了身后独眼巨人赶来的脚步声，也看到了不远处那个女孩脸上疑惑的表情。\n但他没有停留，而是迈开脚步向着他们消失的方向追赶而去。\n他觉得自己有些不好意思向那位会用忧伤的目光注视着他的女性解释究竟发生了什么。\n而且，终究是自己的伙伴......总不能真的就看着他们这样跑走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们——倒是——跑慢一点——！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"愤怒的吼声在黑森林的上空回荡，久久没有散去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等我呀，我也要和你们一起去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
